The native DeepDOC engines (pdfium / office_oxide) are not linked into
this Python process. PDF text uses pdfplumber from the explorer extra.
DOCX and XLSX are read from their OOXML packages. Legacy .doc, .xls,
and .ppt stay unsupported without those native engines.
